    "final_verdict": "VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe derived property sits in exactly the right unit. `contactPreference` is computed purely from the `Owner`'s own `email` field, so placing it as a `@Transient` getter on the `Owner` entity is the natural home \u2014 no service or controller plumbing is warranted for a field-derived value.\n\nIt also mirrors the existing idiom directly above it (`getCityRegion()`, a `@Transient` getter deriving a value from the owner's own `city`), so a maintainer of this codebase would find it immediately familiar. The Javadoc and the OpenAPI schema entry stay in sync with each other and with the spec, and nothing is duplicated. Nothing to change structurally.",
